 flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; color: var(--fg); text-align: left;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--mute);"></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 550;">User</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--mute);">1/2</span></button><button style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; color: var(--fg); text-align: left;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--mute);"></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 550;">Admin</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--mute);">1/2</span></button></div></div><div><div style="padding: 0px 4px 9px;"><div style="font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute);">Journeys</div><div style="font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--mute); margin-top: 2px;">Open a journey to inspect</div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;"><button style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; width: 100%; padding: 8px 9px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid; background: var(--inset); color: var(--fg); cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; border-width: var(--border); border-style: var(--border); border-color: var(--border);"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--accentSoft); color: var(--accent); font-size: 11px; flex-grow: 0; flex-sh